

**10.2.15**: \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi}/2}K_{n+1}(z) = \frac{1}{2}\pi ie^{(n+1)\frac{1}{2}n}h_{n}^{(1)}(ze^{1\pi i})\] \[(-\pi < \arg\,z\leq \frac{1}{2}\pi)\] \[= - \frac{1}{2}\pi ie^{-(n+1)\frac{1}{2}n}h_{n}^{(2)}(ze^{-1\pi i})\] \[(\frac{1}{2}\pi < \arg\,z\leq\pi)\] \[= (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}\sum\limits_{0}^{\rm a}\,(n+\frac{1}{2},\, k)(2z)^{-k}\]
**10.2.16**: \[K_{n+1}(z) = K_{-n-1}(z)\qquad(n = 0,\,1,\,2,\,\ldots)\] \[\mbox{The Functions}\,\sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi}/z}K_{n+1}(z),n = 0,\,1,\,2\]
**10.2.17**: \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}\] \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}(1+z^{-1})\] \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}(1+3z^{-1}+3z^{-2})\] **Elementary Properties Recurrence Relations**: \[f_{n}(z) : \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}I_{n+1}(z),\,(-1)^{n+1}\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}K_{n+1}(z)\] (\(n = 0,\,\pm 1,\,\pm 2,\,\ldots\))
**10.2.18**: \[f_{n-1}(z) - f_{n+1}(z) = (2n+1)2^{-1}f_{n}(z)\]
**10.2.19**: \[nf_{n-1}(z) + (n+1)f_{n+1}(z) = (2n+1)\frac{d}{dz}f_{n}(z)\]
**10.2.20**: \[\frac{n+1}{z}\,f_{n}(z) + \frac{d}{dz}f_{n}(z) = f_{n-1}(z)\] (See 10.2.22.)
**10.2.21**: \[-\frac{n}{z}f_{n}(z) + \frac{d}{dz}f_{n}(z) = \overline{f_{n+1}(z)}\] (See 10.2.23.)
**Differentiation Formulas**: \[f_{n}(z) : \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}I_{n+1}(z),\,(-1)^{n+1}\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/2}K_{n+1}(z)\] (\(n = 0,\,\pm 1,\,\pm 2,\,\ldots\))
**10.2.22**: \[\left(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}[z^{n+1}\!\!f_{n}(z)] = z^{n-m+1}\!\!f_{n-m}(z)\]
**10.2.23**: \[\left(\frac{1}{z}\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}[z^{-1}\!\!f_{n}(z)] = z^{-n-m}\!\!f_{n+m}(z)\] (\(m = 1,\,2,\,3,\,\ldots\))
